{"id": "d28528b2-d4c6-4c09-acec-d9e78f13ab07", "slug": "dynamo-real-time-stream-processing", "title": "Dynamo — Real-Time Stream Processing", "description": "Dynamo Real Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Dynamo — Real-Time Stream Processing\"\ndescription: \"Dynamo Real Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#06B6D4\"\n  secondary: \"#06060C\"\n  accent: \"#0A3D4A\"\n  background: \"#06060C\"\n  surface: \"#0A3D4A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Dynamo — Real-Time Stream Processing\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 11; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, charts.\n## Overview\nDynamo Real Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nDynamo Streams Pipelines Connectors Docs Start Free Stream Processing v5.0 Process streams at any scale Dynamo processes millions of events per second with sub-millisecond latency. Build real-time pipelines, transforms,…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Process streams at any scale; Real-time intelligence for modern infrastructure.; Sub-millisecond compute; Infinite auto-scaling; Built for the modern enterprise.; Trusted by engineering leaders worldwide.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #06B6D4, secondary #06060C, accent #0A3D4A, background #06060C, surface #0A3D4A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dynamo — Real-Time Stream Processing</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#06060c] text-slate-200 antialiased font-sans overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-100\">\n    \n    <!-- Noise Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[9999] pointer-events-none opacity-[0.025]\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;); background-size:128px 128px\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"c\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-6 left-0 right-0 z-50 flex justify-center px-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full backdrop-blur-xl bg-[#06060c]/65 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white decoration-none group\">\n                <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0a3d4a] to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(6,182,212,0.3)] group-hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(6,182,212,0.5)] transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" class=\"text-white text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                Dynamo\n            </a>\n            <ul class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Streams</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Pipelines</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Connectors</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Docs</a></li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:inline-flex px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-cyan-500/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)] transition-all duration-300\">\n                Start Free\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen px-6 pt-24 text-center\">\n        <!-- Fade Bottom for Canvas -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-48 pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[#06060c]\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/5 border border-cyan-500/15 mb-6 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(6,182,212,0.8)] animate-pulse\"></div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-cyan-400\">Stream Processing v5.0</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5rem] font-extralight tracking-tight leading-[1.1] max-w-4xl text-white\">\n            Process streams at<br>\n            <span class=\"font-light text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400 to-cyan-200\">any scale</span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm md:text-base text-slate-400 font-light max-w-xl leading-relaxed\">\n            Dynamo processes millions of events per second with sub-millisecond latency. Build real-time pipelines, transforms, and aggregations without managing infrastructure.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-10\">\n            <button class=\"relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-white text-sm font-medium border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.1)] hover:bg-cyan-500/20 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all duration-300 group\">\n                <span class=\"relative z-10\">Deploy Pipeline</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300\">\n                View Demo\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 md:gap-16 mt-20 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 w-full max-w-3xl\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-1\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400\">8.4</span>M</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\">Events / sec</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-1\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400\">0.12</span>ms</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\">P99 latency</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-1\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400\">99.999</span>%</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\">Uptime SLA</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-1\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400\">2,400</span>+</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\">Connectors</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 opacity-30\">\n            <span class=\"text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Explore</span>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-400 to-transparent animate-pulse\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Masked Reveal Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-32 px-6 relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-white masked-container flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 md:gap-x-4 gap-y-2\">\n            <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%); display: inline-block;\">Real-time</span></span>\n            <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%); display: inline-block;\">intelligence</span></span>\n            <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%); display: inline-block;\">for</span></span>\n            <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-word font-normal text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-400\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%); display: inline-block;\">modern</span></span>\n            <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%); display: inline-block;\">infrastructure.</span></span>\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-8 text-sm md:text-base text-slate-400 max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed reveal-fade\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n            Stop waiting for batch jobs. Dynamo ingests, transforms, and routes millions of events as they happen, ensuring your downstream systems and AI models are perpetually synchronized with reality.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Feature Grid with Border Gradients & Aura Assets -->\n    <section class=\"py-24 px-6 relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n            <!-- Card 1 -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent group\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-[#06060c] h-full overflow-hidden relative\">\n                    <div class=\"h-64 w-full relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#06060c] via-[#06060c]/60 to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4734259a-bad7-422f-981e-ce01e79184f2_1600w.jpg\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full opacity-50 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000\" alt=\"Abstract gradient\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 relative z-20 -mt-20\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-black/50\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-400 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Sub-millisecond compute</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">Our proprietary engine processes events closer to the metal, bypassing traditional JVM overhead for unparalleled data velocity.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Card 2 -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent group\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-[#06060c] h-full overflow-hidden relative\">\n                    <div class=\"h-64 w-full relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#06060c] via-[#06060c]/60 to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/e534354d-c5f2-4399-a1d9-2f50338e8c47_1600w.jpg\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full opacity-50 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000\" alt=\"Abstract wave\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 relative z-20 -mt-20\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-black/50\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:git-network-linear\" class=\"text-purple-400 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Infinite auto-scaling</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">Dynamically adds partitions and rescales consumer groups as your throughput increases, entirely without manual intervention.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Architecture Large Showcase -->\n    <section class=\"py-24 px-6 relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/20 via-white/5 to-transparent\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-[#06060c] overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch\">\n                <div class=\"p-10 md:p-20 md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center gap-6 z-20 relative bg-[#06060c]/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-white leading-tight\">\n                        Built for the <br>\n                        <span class=\"font-normal text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500\">modern enterprise.</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                        Deploy on bare metal, Kubernetes, or leverage our fully managed cloud service. Secure by default with end-to-end encryption, strict RBAC, and zero-trust architecture.\n                    </p>\n                    <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 font-light\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-500 text-lg\"></iconify-icon> SOC2 Type II Certified\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 font-light\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-500 text-lg\"></iconify-icon> VPC Peering & PrivateLink\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 font-light\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-500 text-lg\"></iconify-icon> 99.999% SLA Guarantee\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-cyan-400 font-medium hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors\">\n                            Read the architecture whitepaper <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"md:w-1/2 w-full h-80 md:h-auto relative min-h-[400px]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t md:bg-gradient-to-r from-[#06060c] via-[#06060c]/40 to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                    <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/005600e5-f6ab-4e59-bc86-eaeb02797dfa_1600w.jpg\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full opacity-60\" alt=\"Modern glass villa architecture\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Testimonials -->\n    <section class=\"py-24 px-6 relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center border-t border-white/5 mt-12 mb-24\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-16\">Trusted by engineering leaders worldwide</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-left\">\n            <div class=\"flex gap-5 items-start\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/2f563338-39fa-47ea-9761-658d4f3f84db_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover border border-white/10 shrink-0 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" alt=\"Portrait David\">\n                <div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 font-light italic mb-4 leading-relaxed\">\"Dynamo allowed us to deprecate three disparate streaming clusters into a single unified pipeline. The latency drop across our trading floors was immediate.\"</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">David Chen</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-light mt-0.5\">VP Engineering, FinTech Co</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-5 items-start\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover border border-white/10 shrink-0 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" alt=\"Portrait Sarah\">\n                <div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 font-light italic mb-4 leading-relaxed\">\"The developer experience is simply unmatched. We were able to ship our new real-time fraud detection engine three months ahead of schedule.\"</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Sarah Jenkins</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-light mt-0.5\">Staff Engineer, Retail Giant</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Animations\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const container = document.querySelector('.masked-container');\n            if(container) {\n                // Staggered word reveal\n                gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    ease: \"power4.out\",\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    stagger: 0.06,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: container,\n                        start: \"top 80%\",\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Fade in description text\n                gsap.to('.reveal-fade', {\n                    y: 0,\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: container,\n                        start: \"top 75%\",\n                    },\n                    delay: 0.4\n                });\n            }\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Canvas Background (from reference)\n        (function(){\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('c');\n            if(!canvas) return;\n            const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl',{alpha:true,antialias:false,premultipliedAlpha:false});\n            if(!gl) return;\n\n            let mx=0.5, my=0.5;\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{\n                mx = e.clientX/window.innerWidth;\n                my = 1.0 - e.clientY/window.innerHeight;\n            });\n            document.addEventListener('touchmove',e=>{\n                if(e.touches.length>0){\n                    mx = e.touches[0].clientX/window.innerWidth;\n                    my = 1.0 - e.touches[0].clientY/window.innerHeight;\n                }\n            },{passive:true});\n\n            function resize(){\n                const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio,1.5);\n                const W = window.innerWidth;\n                const H = window.innerHeight;\n                canvas.width = W*dpr; canvas.height = H*dpr;\n                gl.viewport(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);\n            }\n\n            const VS = `attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0,1);}`;\n            const FS = `\n            precision highp float;\n            uniform float u_t;\n            uniform vec2 u_r;\n            uniform vec2 u_m;\n\n            float hash(vec2 p){ return fract(sin(dot(p,vec2(127.1,311.7)))*43758.5453123); }\n\n            float noise(vec2 p){\n                vec2 i=floor(p); vec2 f=fract(p); f=f*f*(3.0-2.0*f);\n                float a=hash(i); float b=hash(i+vec2(1.0,0.0));\n                float c=hash(i+vec2(0.0,1.0)); float d=hash(i+vec2(1.0,1.0));\n                return mix(mix(a,b,f.x),mix(c,d,f.x),f.y);\n            }\n\n            float fbm3(vec2 p){\n                float v=0.0; v+=0.5*noise(p); p*=2.01; v+=0.25*noise(p); p*=2.02; v+=0.125*noise(p); return v;\n            }\n\n            float tendril(vec2 p, float a, float t, float seed){\n                float ca=cos(a), sa=sin(a);\n                vec2 rp=vec2(p.x*ca+p.y*sa, -p.x*sa+p.y*ca);\n                if(rp.x<0.01) return 1.0;\n                float r=rp.x;\n                float len=0.24+0.08*sin(t*0.6+seed*3.7);\n                if(r>len) return 1.0;\n                float nr=r/len;\n                float disp=0.0;\n                disp+=fbm3(vec2(r*18.0+seed*7.0, t*2.5+seed))*0.04;\n                disp+=noise(vec2(r*35.0+seed*13.0, t*4.0+seed*2.0))*0.02;\n                disp+=noise(vec2(r*70.0+seed*5.0, t*6.0))*0.008;\n                disp*=(0.3+nr*0.7);\n                float perpDist=abs(rp.y-disp);\n                float tipFade=smoothstep(1.0,0.7,nr);\n                float baseFade=smoothstep(0.0,0.15,nr);\n                return perpDist/(tipFade*baseFade+0.001);\n            }\n\n            void main(){\n                vec2 uv=gl_FragCoord.xy/u_r;\n                float aspect=u_r.x/u_r.y;\n                vec2 p=(uv-0.5)*vec2(aspect,1.0);\n                float t=u_t;\n                float dist=length(p);\n                float globeR=0.16;\n\n                float ringDist=abs(dist-globeR);\n                float ring=smoothstep(0.008,0.001,ringDist);\n                float ringOuter=smoothstep(0.025,0.003,ringDist)*0.4;\n                float inner=smoothstep(globeR,globeR*0.2,dist)*0.12;\n                float angle=atan(p.y,p.x);\n                float plasma=fbm3(vec2(angle*2.0+t*0.3, dist*8.0-t*0.5));\n                float innerPlasma=plasma*inner*0.6;\n                float halo=exp(-pow(dist-globeR,2.0)*80.0)*0.25;\n                float haloWide=exp(-dist*dist*4.0)*0.08;\n\n                vec3 col=vec3(0.0);\n                col+=vec3(0.02,0.45,0.55)*haloWide;\n                col+=vec3(0.04,0.65,0.78)*halo;\n                col+=vec3(0.03,0.50,0.62)*inner;\n                col+=vec3(0.05,0.72,0.84)*innerPlasma;\n                col+=vec3(0.20,0.82,0.92)*ringOuter;\n                col+=vec3(0.40,0.95,1.0)*ring*0.30;\n\n                vec2 mp=(u_m-0.5)*vec2(aspect,1.0);\n                float mouseAngle=atan(mp.y,mp.x);\n                float tendrilBright=0.0;\n\n                float a0=0.0*0.8976+t*0.05+sin(t*0.08)*0.25; a0+=smoothstep(0.8,0.0,abs(a0-mouseAngle))*0.15*sin(mouseAngle);\n                float d0=tendril(p,a0,t,0.0); tendrilBright+=(exp(-d0*d0*8000.0)+exp(-d0*d0*600.0)*0.5)*(0.7+0.3*sin(t*3.0+0.0));\n\n                float a1=1.0*0.8976+t*0.05+sin(t*0.09+1.7)*0.25; a1+=smoothstep(0.8,0.0,abs(a1-mouseAngle))*0.15*sin(mouseAngle);\n                float d1=tendril(p,a1,t,1.0); tendrilBright+=(exp(-d1*d1*8000.0)+exp(-d1*d1*600.0)*0.5)*(0.7+0.3*sin(t*3.2+1.1));\n\n                float a2=2.0*0.8976+t*0.05+sin(t*0.07+3.4)*0.25; a2+=smoothstep(0.8,0.0,abs(a2-mouseAngle))*0.15*sin(mouseAngle);\n                float d2=tendril(p,a2,t,2.0); tendrilBright+=(exp(-d2*d2*8000.0)+exp(-d2*d2*600.0)*0.5)*(0.7+0.3*sin(t*2.8+2.2));\n\n                float a3=3.0*0.8976+t*0.05+sin(t*0.11+5.1)*0.25; a3+=smoothstep(0.8,0.0,abs(a3-mouseAngle))*0.15*sin(mouseAngle);\n                float d3=tendril(p,a3,t,3.0); tendrilBright+=(exp(-d3*d3*8000.0)+exp(-d3*d3*600.0)*0.5)*(0.7+0.3*sin(t*3.5+3.3));\n\n                float a4=4.0*0.8976+t*0.05+sin(t*0.10+6.8)*0.25; a4+=smoothstep(0.8,0.0,abs(a4-mouseAngle))*0.15*sin(mouseAngle);\n                float d4=tendril(p,a4,t,4.0); tendrilBright+=(exp(-d4*d4*8000.0)+exp(-d4*d4*600.0)*0.5)*(0.7+0.3*sin(t*2.6+4.4));\n\n                float tendrilCore=min(tendrilBright,1.0);\n                vec3 tendrilCol=mix(vec3(0.04,0.72,0.84), vec3(0.70,0.96,1.0), tendrilCore*0.6);\n                col+=tendrilCol*tendrilBright*0.28;\n\n                float radLines=0.0;\n                for(int i=0;i<12;i++){\n                    float la=float(i)*0.5236+t*0.02;\n                    float angleDiff=abs(mod(angle-la+3.14159,6.28318)-3.14159);\n                    float line=exp(-angleDiff*angleDiff*400.0)*0.03;\n                    line*=smoothstep(globeR-0.02,globeR+0.04,dist);\n                    line*=smoothstep(0.55,0.25,dist);\n                    radLines+=line;\n                }\n                col+=vec3(0.03,0.45,0.55)*radLines;\n\n                float sparkNoise=noise(vec2(angle*6.0+t*3.0,dist*20.0+t*2.0));\n                float sparkZone=smoothstep(0.06,0.0,abs(dist-globeR))*sparkNoise*0.18;\n                col+=vec3(0.30,0.90,1.0)*sparkZone;\n\n                float particles=noise(vec2(p.x*30.0+t*0.5,p.y*30.0-t*0.3));\n                particles=pow(particles,8.0)*0.08;\n                particles*=smoothstep(0.6,0.15,dist);\n                col+=vec3(0.04,0.60,0.72)*particles;\n\n                float bgGrad=exp(-dist*dist*1.5)*0.025;\n                col+=vec3(0.02,0.30,0.40)*bgGrad;\n\n                float vig=1.0-smoothstep(0.25,0.75,dist);\n                col*=0.55+0.45*vig;\n                col=clamp(col,0.0,0.45);\n\n                gl_FragColor=vec4(col,1.0);\n            }\n            `;\n\n            function compile(src,type){\n                const s=gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s,src);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            }\n\n            const vs=compile(VS,gl.VERTEX_SHADER);\n            const fs=compile(FS,gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER);\n            if(!vs||!fs) return;\n\n            const prog=gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog,vs); gl.attachShader(prog,fs); gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const buf=gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER,buf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER,new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]),gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n            const pA=gl.getAttribLocation(prog,'p');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pA);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(pA,2,gl.FLOAT,false,0,0);\n\n            const uT=gl.getUniformLocation(prog,'u_t');\n            const uR=gl.getUniformLocation(prog,'u_r');\n            const uM=gl.getUniformLocation(prog,'u_m');\n\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize',resize);\n\n            let startTime=performance.now();\n            (function loop(){\n                const elapsed=(performance.now()-startTime)*0.001;\n                gl.uniform1f(uT,elapsed);\n                gl.uniform2f(uR,canvas.width,canvas.height);\n                gl.uniform2f(uM,mx,my);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP,0,4);\n                requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n            })();\n        })();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "dynamo-real-time-stream-processing.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/dynamo-real-time-stream-processing.jpg", "source_name": "dynamo-real-time-stream-processing-DESIGN.md", "views": 53, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T16:42:24.958221+00:00"}